		  <style></style><div style="opacity:0" class="sc-faUpoM cFOwMS __pf __pf_aO6w_-nb" id="__pf"><div data-pf-type="Body" class="sc-ksHpcM hkPZIR pf-1_"><div data-pf-type="Layout" class="sc-cVAmsi cFAsxI pf-2_"><div data-section-id="pf-bb17" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-igXgud lhtyiH pf-3_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-cjrPHo eOcrMz"><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-4_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-5_"><h1 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bSqaIl iXTDAP pf-6_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-8_">Custom Design</span></h1></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-fdfb" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-igXgud lhtyiH pf-9_"><div class="sc-cjrPHo eOcrMz"><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-10_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-11_"><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-12_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-14_">Kessick is happy to create a 2D Custom Design for a fee of $150. We will review the request to determine if it is within the parameters of a Wine As Art design and to confirm material availability. Within two business days, you will receive information about the design and, assuming the project is accepted, an invoice for $150. The design fee is non-refundable, but will be credited on all sales over $1500. You will receive the design, along with the corresponding quote, within five business days of paying the design fee. Custom designs typically ship within 4 weeks of placing the order. If you have any questions, please contact us&nbsp;<a href="mailto:sales@kessick.com?subject=Custom%20Design%20Question">sales@kessick.com</a>.<br><br>A Wine As Art custom design consists of panels, hardware, and optional lighting. A design can consist of one or multiple panels with a maximum single panel size of 48 x 96”. The panels can be of different shapes and sizes to accommodate the room. A custom wine wall will typically cost between $100 and $130 per square foot, depending on the panel material and wine hardware configuration. Nature Plus is the most economical option. The cost of lighting is not considered in the above scenarios.<br><br>Factory-designed and installed back perimeter 12V LED lighting is available in two options:</span></p><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-15_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-17_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Plug and Play lighting</span>&nbsp;consist of dimming tape lighting controlled by a remote control and powered by a compact driver built into a 110V plug. This makes lighting very easy. The cord hangs down from the panel and is plugged into a nearby power outlet within five feet. Lighting color is 3000K.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Custom Lighting</span>&nbsp;is recommended for contractors, new construction, or advanced DIY. What makes custom lighting unique is the low voltage LED wires are “roughed in” in the wall to hide the wires and are routed to a driver. There are no visible wires in custom lighting.  The driver is wired to a dimmable wall switch. The power source (outlet or hardwired) and controls (wall switch) are not supplied by Kessick. Lighting will come in 3000K unless otherwise specified in the design request. Consult a qualified electrician and observe all local building codes.</span></p><p class="sc-ehIJor eZpnKY pf-18_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-20_">Panel Options depends on availability. Our wood/stain options are always in stock. Nature Plus, Brillante and Zenit availability varies. If we are unable to source the desired panel, we will contact you to discuss your options.</span></p><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-21_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" d